ndow.HMR_WEBSOCKET_URL = 'wss://12321-project-name.ws-eu09.gitpod.io';\r\n```\r\n\r\n~~Actually just setting `window.HMR_WEBSOCKET_PORT` to 80 could even help~~ in the case based on [Snowpack source code](https://github.com/snowpackjs/snowpack/blob/680272eb19c43ef88f9d83e436e7131444c53407/snowpack/assets/hmr-client.js#L49-L56) but unfortunately Astro [overriding it.](https://github.com/snowpackjs/astro/blob/main/packages/astro/src/compiler/transform/head.ts#L65)","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/issues/404/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/issues/404/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/issues/17772","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/issues/17772/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/issues/17772/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/issues/17772/events","html_url":"https://github.com/withastro/astro/pull/17772","id":5204564175,"node_id":"PR_kwDOFL76Q88AAAABAbfgNQ","number":17772,"title":"Normalize request paths before route matching","user":{"login":"matthewp","id":361671,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MTY3MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/361671?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/matthewp","html_url":"https://github.com/matthewp","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matthewp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matthewp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matthewp/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matthewp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matthewp/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matthewp/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matthewp/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matthewp/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matthewp/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":3559105225,"node_id":"LA_kwDOFL76Q87UI6LJ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/labels/pkg:%20astro","name":"pkg: astro","color":"b4a8d1","default":false,"description":"Related to the core `astro` package (scope)","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":3,"created_at":"2026-08-20T14:34:08Z","updated_at":"2026-08-24T22:07:24Z","closed_at":"2026-08-24T22:07:22Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/pulls/17772","html_url":"https://github.com/withastro/astro/pull/17772","diff_url":"https://github.com/withastro/astro/pull/17772.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/withastro/astro/pull/17772.patch","merged_at":"2026-08-24T22:07:22Z"},"body":"## Changes\n\n- Repeatedly encoded characters can make a request select a catch-all route instead of the exact page users expect. For example, `/docs/%2567uide` can be matched differently from its normalized `/docs/guide` path, including between development and deployed apps.\n- Fully normalizes pathnames before adapter and development route matching, so route selection and rendering use the same pathname while preserving adapter-provided route data.\n\n## Testing\n\n- Adds app-level coverage confirming a multi-encoded request selects the exact route before adapter rendering.\n\n## Docs\n\n- No docs update needed because this corrects internal route selection without changing public APIs.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/issues/17772/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/issues/17772/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/issues/17445","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/issues/17445/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/issues/17445/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/issues/17445/events","html_url":"https://github.com/withastro/astro/pull/17445","id":4921835804,"node_id":"PR_kwDOFL76Q87zfn-2","number":17445,"title":"fix(astro): update `cookie` to v2","user":{"login":"ocavue","id":24715727,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0NzE1NzI3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24715727?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ocavue","html_url":"https://github.com/ocavue","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ocavue/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ocavue/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ocavue/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ocavue/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ocavue/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ocavue/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ocavue/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ocavue/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ocavue/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":3559105225,"node_id":"LA_kwDOFL76Q87UI6LJ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/labels/pkg:%20astro","name":"pkg: astro","color":"b4a8d1","default":false,"description":"Related to the core `astro` package (scope)","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":6474182039,"node_id":"LA_kwDOFL76Q88AAAABgeQtlw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/labels/dependencies","name":"dependencies","color":"0366d6","default":false,"description":"Pull requests that update a dependency file","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2026-07-19T07:41:44Z","updated_at":"2026-07-19T12:51:53Z","closed_at":"2026-07-19T12:51:52Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/pulls/17445","html_url":"https://github.com/withastro/astro/pull/17445","diff_url":"https://github.com/withastro/astro/pull/17445.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/withastro/astro/pull/17445.patch","merged_at":"2026-07-19T12:51:52Z"},"body":"## Changes\r\n\r\n1. Updates `cookie` to v2\r\n2. Migrates `AstroCookies` to the new `parseCookie` / `stringifySetCookie` API. \r\n3. Refactored the code by a bit.\r\n \r\nThe only observable change is the default `encode`: values made entirely of cookie-safe characters are no longer percent-encoded in `Set-Cookie` headers, and every value still round-trips exactly as before.\r\n\r\n| `Astro.cookies.set('foo', value)` | `Set-Cookie` before <br> (`cookie` v1) | `Set-Cookie` after <br> (`cookie` v2) |\r\n| --- | --- | --- |\r\n| `'bar'` | `foo=bar` | `foo=bar` |\r\n| `'http://localhost/path'` | `foo=http%3A%2F%2Flocalhost%2Fpath` | `foo=http://localhost/path` |\r\n| `'hello world'` | `foo=hello%20world` | `foo=hello%20world` |\r\n\r\n\r\nChangelog (not very useful IMO): https://github.com/jshttp/cookie/releases/tag/v2.0.0\r\n\r\n## Testing\r\n\r\nAdded a new test \r\n\r\n\r\n<!-- How was this change tested? -->\r\n<!-- DON'T DELETE THIS SECTION! If no tests added, explain why. -->\r\n\r\n## Docs\r\n\r\nAdded a Changesets file because there is a tiny behavior change. \r\n\r\nI could copy the Markdown table above into the Changesets file too if reviewers believe it would be better.\r\n\r\n<!-- Could this affect a user’s behavior? We probably need to update docs! -->\r\n<!-- If docs will be needed or you’re not sure, uncomment the next line: -->\r\n<!-- /cc @withastro/maintainers-docs for feedback! -->\r\n\r\n<!-- DON'T DELETE THIS SECTION! If no docs added, explain why.-->\r\n<!-- https://github.com/withastro/docs -->\r\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/issues/17445/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/issues/17445/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/issues/17113","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/issues/17113/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/issues/17113/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/issues/17113/events","html_url":"https://github.com/withastro/astro/pull/17113","id":4685986716,"node_id":"PR_kwDOFL76Q87nnUwj","number":17113,"title":"fix: allow valid encoded reserved pathnames","user":{"login":"TorbjornHoltmon","id":46750288,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2NzUwMjg4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46750288?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TorbjornHoltmon","html_url":"https://github.com/TorbjornHoltmon","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TorbjornHoltmon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TorbjornHoltmon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TorbjornHoltmon/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TorbjornHoltmon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TorbjornHoltmon/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TorbjornHoltmon/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TorbjornHoltmon/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TorbjornHoltmon/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TorbjornHoltmon/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":3559105225,"node_id":"LA_kwDOFL76Q87UI6LJ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/labels/pkg:%20astro","name":"pkg: astro","color":"b4a8d1","default":false,"description":"Related to the core `astro` package (scope)","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-06-17T18:25:16Z","updated_at":"2026-06-17T18:27:05Z","closed_at":"2026-06-17T18:27:05Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/pulls/17113","html_url":"https://github.com/withastro/astro/pull/17113","diff_url":"https://github.com/withastro/astro/pull/17113.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/withastro/astro/pull/17113.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"## Summary\n\nFixes a false-positive pathname validation failure in Astro 5 where valid encoded paths containing both decoded characters and encoded reserved URI characters could fail before route matching.\n\nFor example, `/foo%20%26bar` is valid: `decodeURI()` decodes `%20` to a space but intentionally leaves `%26` encoded because `&` is reserved. Astro 5 treated the remaining `%26` as multi-level encoding and returned 404 before a matching route could render.\n\n## Changes\n\n- Canonicalizes pathnames by repeatedly applying `decodeURI()` until stable with a bounded iteration limit.\n- Reuses the shared pathname canonicalization for rewrite route matching.\n- Adds unit coverage for encoded reserved characters, invalid encodings, and multi-level encoded paths.\n- Adds middleware coverage showing `/encoded/foo%20%26bar` routes successfully while encoded `/admin` aliases are still blocked by auth middleware.\n- Adds a patch changeset for `astro`.\n\n## Testing\n\n- `pnpm --filter astro build:ci`\n- `cd packages/astro && node --test test/units/util/validate-and-decode-pathname.test.js`\n- `cd packages/astro && node --test test/middleware.test.js`\n- `cd packages/astro && pnpm run test:unit`\n- `cd packages/astro && pnpm run test:match \"test/middleware.test.js\"`","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/issues/17113/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/issues/17113/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/issues/17251","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/issues/17251/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/issues/17251/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/issues/17251/events","html_url":"https://github.com/withastro/astro/pull/17251","id":4786253763,"node_id":"PR_kwDOFL76Q87stVJ_","number":17251,"title":"Validate attribute names on custom HTML elements during SSR","user":{"login":"matthewp","id":361671,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MTY3MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/361671?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/matthewp","html_url":"https://github.com/matthewp","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matthewp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matthewp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matthewp/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matthewp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matthewp/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matthewp/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matthewp/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matthewp/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matthewp/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":3559105225,"node_id":"LA_kwDOFL76Q87UI6LJ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/labels/pkg:%20astro","name":"pkg: astro","color":"b4a8d1","default":false,"description":"Related to the core `astro` package (scope)","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2026-07-01T14:01:38Z","updated_at":"2026-07-02T14:50:07Z","closed_at":"2026-07-02T14:50:04Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/pulls/17251","html_url":"https://github.com/withastro/astro/pull/17251","diff_url":"https://github.com/withastro/astro/pull/17251.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/withastro/astro/pull/17251.patch","merged_at":"2026-07-02T14:50:04Z"},"body":"## Changes\n\n- Applies the existing attribute name validation to custom HTML element rendering during SSR. Attribute names containing characters invalid per the HTML spec (`\" ' > / =` or whitespace) are now dropped instead of interpolated raw, preventing unsafe HTML output.\n\n## Testing\n\n- Adds `renderHTMLElement rejects invalid attribute keys` test suite covering malicious keys (event handler injection, script tag injection) and valid keys (namespaced, `data-*`).\n\n## Docs\n\n- No docs update needed — this is an internal hardening fix with no user-facing API change.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/issues/17251/reactions","total_count