,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2026-06-10T13:19:19Z","updated_at":"2026-06-10T14:57:50Z","closed_at":"2026-06-10T14:57:48Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/pulls/17026","html_url":"https://github.com/withastro/astro/pull/17026","diff_url":"https://github.com/withastro/astro/pull/17026.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/withastro/astro/pull/17026.patch","merged_at":"2026-06-10T14:57:48Z"},"body":"## Changes\n\n- Validates attribute names in `addAttribute()` against the HTML spec before interpolating them into output. Keys containing characters invalid in attribute names (`\"`, `'`, `>`, `/`, `=`, or whitespace) are silently dropped.\n\n## Testing\n\n- Added `addAttribute rejects invalid attribute keys` suite (7 cases) covering keys with `\"`, spaces, `>`, `'`, `=`, plus positive cases for normal names (`data-foo`, `aria-label`) and namespaced attributes (`on:click`, `xmlns:happy`).\n- Added `spreadAttributes rejects invalid attribute keys` suite (1 case) verifying invalid keys are dropped while valid siblings are preserved.\n\n## Docs\n\n- No docs update needed. Internal rendering hardening with no user-facing API change.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/issues/17026/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/issues/17026/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/issues/16815","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/issues/16815/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/issues/16815/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/issues/16815/events","html_url":"https://github.com/withastro/astro/pull/16815","id":4490029481,"node_id":"PR_kwDOFL76Q87dtMXo","number":16815,"title":"Normalize wrangler.jsonc worker name","user":{"login":"ericclemmons","id":15182,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1MTgy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/15182?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ericclemmons","html_url":"https://github.com/ericclemmons","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ericclemmons/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ericclemmons/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ericclemmons/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ericclemmons/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ericclemmons/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ericclemmons/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ericclemmons/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ericclemmons/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ericclemmons/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":3559105225,"node_id":"LA_kwDOFL76Q87UI6LJ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/labels/pkg:%20astro","name":"pkg: astro","color":"b4a8d1","default":false,"description":"Related to the core `astro` package (scope)","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":3,"created_at":"2026-05-20T21:27:42Z","updated_at":"2026-05-21T01:07:38Z","closed_at":"2026-05-21T00:59:36Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/pulls/16815","html_url":"https://github.com/withastro/astro/pull/16815","diff_url":"https://github.com/withastro/astro/pull/16815.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/withastro/astro/pull/16815.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"## Changes\n\nNormalize the package name before `astro add cloudflare` writes it to generated `wrangler.jsonc` as the Cloudflare Worker name.\n\nPreviously, a package name like `example.org` was written directly as:\n\n```json\n\"name\": \"example.org\"\n```\n\nWrangler/Workers require names to use alphanumeric characters and dashes, so this now writes:\n\n```json\n\"name\": \"example-org\"\n```\n\n## Testing\n\n- `pnpm exec biome check \"packages/astro/src/cli/add/index.ts\"`\n- `pnpm --filter astro build:ci`\n\nThe normalization is a small inline transform next to the generated `wrangler.jsonc` write.\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/issues/16815/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/issues/16815/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"score":1.0}],"search_type":"lexical"}